    "created_at": "2019-10-22T11:00:27Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-10-22T11:00:27Z",
    "body": "Apologies for the late reply, I think the PR looks okay, but the point @mayhemer raises above is important. These headers are the way Firefox deals with the local cache. Other implementations might have a similar setup. That's why we need a set of tests and implementer agreement to implement the division as you would like to see it.",
